{"id":"fa_brica","lemma":"fábrica","pos":"noun","rank":1531,"glosses":["factory"],"ipa":"/ˈfabɾika/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"fábricas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6e/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-f%C3%A1brica.wav","examples":[{"text":"Mi padre trabaja en una fábrica.","en":"My father works in a factory.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/589888","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"father, parent"},{"g":"to work","l":"trabajar"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Vayamos a la fábrica.","en":"Let's go to the factory.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/594478","words":[{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Han decidido cerrar esta fábrica.","en":"They've decided to shut down this factory.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/704351","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"decided"},{"g":"to close, to shut"},{"g":"this","l":"este"},null]},{"text":"El humo de las fábricas contamina el aire.","en":"Exhaust from factories pollutes the air.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"smoke"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"to contaminate","l":"contaminar"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"air"}]},{"text":"No voy a llegar a tiempo a la fábrica.","en":"I won't reach the factory in time.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/422408","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"to arrive, get"},null,null,{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / her"},null],"phrases":[[4,6,"in time"]]}]}